      "optionNotes": ["Wrong: marker colour is black; it should be grey; number of bottom dots is 3; it should be 4.","Correct: marker position: upper-right; arrow direction: 135° clockwise from up; marker colour: grey; number of bottom dots: 4.","Wrong: arrow direction is 90° clockwise from up; it should be 135° clockwise from up.","Wrong: marker position is lower-left; it should be upper-right; number of bottom dots is 3; it should be 4.","Wrong: marker position is upper-left; it should be upper-right; number of bottom dots is 1; it should be 4."],
      "solution": ["read odd and even frames separately: the marker moves 3 places anticlockwise between consecutive odd frames and 3 places clockwise between consecutive even frames. Frames 1–6, marker position: right → lower-left → upper-left → top → bottom → lower-right. Next: upper-right.","from frame 3 the arrow points 315° clockwise from the marker TWO frames earlier. Frames 1–6, arrow direction: 270° clockwise from up → 45° clockwise from up → 45° clockwise from up → 180° clockwise from up → 270° clockwise from up → 315° clockwise from up. Next: 135° clockwise from up.","the marker colour cycles grey → black → white and repeats. Frames 1–6, marker colour: grey → black → white → grey → black → white. Next: grey.","the bottom dots cycle 2 → 3 → 4 → 1 and repeat. Frames 1–6, number of bottom dots: 2 → 3 → 4 → 1 → 2 → 3. Next: 4."],
